<mxfile host="app.diagrams.net"><diagram name="main 기준 실제 배선"><mxGraphModel dx="1400" dy="900" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="2040" pageHeight="2464" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="s0" value="&lt;b&gt;① 고정 웹캠 ×2  ·  천장 USB 카메라&lt;/b&gt;  [하드웨어]&lt;br&gt;camera_open (개방구역) · camera_alley (골목)&lt;br&gt;640×480 JPEG. 같은 노트북 안에서 도는 노드가 직접 읽는다&lt;br&gt;(direct_camera=true — 영상을 DDS 로 왕복시키지 않는다)" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#333333;strokeWidth=2;dashed=0;dashPattern=8 5;fontSize=16;fontColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="48" y="150" width="860" height="123" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="s1" value="&lt;b&gt;프로세스 안에서 직접 전달 · DDS 안 거침&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;cv2.VideoCapture → numpy BGR uint8[480,640,3]&lt;br&gt;15 Hz" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#333333;strokeWidth=2;dashed=0;dashPattern=8 5;fontSize=14;fontColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="228" y="312" width="680" height="89" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="s2" value="&lt;b&gt;② vision_detector ×2  ·  aed_vision&lt;/b&gt;  [구현]&lt;br&gt;YOLO11n 파인튜닝(rescue_yolo11n.pt) — fallen_person · helper&lt;br&gt;확정 규칙: 최근 10프레임 중 6프레임 이상 검출되면 CONFIRMED&lt;br&gt;신뢰도 문턱 rescue_conf = 0.25&lt;br&gt;혼잡도는 alley 카메라만 계산한다 (open 은 mode=open)&lt;br&gt;호모그래피로 픽셀→map 변환은 아직 안 붙었다 (좌표가 0,0)" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#333333;strokeWidth=2;dashed=0;dashPattern=8 5;fontSize=16;fontColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="48" y="441" width="860" height="165" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="s3" value="&lt;b&gt;/{camera_id}/vision/emergency_event&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;aed_interfaces/EmergencyEvent · RELIABLE depth 10&lt;br&gt;상태가 바뀔 때만 (DETECTED→CONFIRMED→RESOLVED)" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#333333;strokeWidth=2;dashed=0;dashPattern=8 5;fontSize=14;fontColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="228" y="645" width="680" height="89" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="s4" value="&lt;b&gt;③ location_mapper  ·  카메라별 → 공용 토픽 중계&lt;/b&gt;  [뼈대 · 콜백 없음]&lt;br&gt;패키지와 노드는 있으나 콜백이 비어 있다 (29줄 scaffold)&lt;br&gt;이것이 없어서 검출이 출동으로 이어지지 않는다" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#C0392B;strokeWidth=2;dashed=1;dashPattern=8 5;fontSize=16;fontColor=#C0392B;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="48" y="774" width="860" height="102" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="s5" value="&lt;b&gt;/aed/emergency_event  ← 발행하는 노드가 없다&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;aed_interfaces/EmergencyEvent · RELIABLE depth 10&lt;br&gt;mission_manager 는 이 토픽을 듣고 있으나 아무것도 안 온다" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#C0392B;strokeWidth=2;dashed=0;dashPattern=8 5;fontSize=14;fontColor=#C0392B;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="228" y="915" width="680" height="89" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="s6" value="&lt;b&gt;④ mission_manager  ·  후보 순위와 배정&lt;/b&gt;  [구현]&lt;br&gt;구독 /aed/emergency_event (10) · /aed/robot_state (20)&lt;br&gt;        /aed/mission_status (20)&lt;br&gt;가용 조건: availability=AVAILABLE ∧ network_ok ∧ nav2_ok ∧ path_valid&lt;br&gt;순위: rank_candidates() — estimated_path_cost 오름차순&lt;br&gt;재할당: 실패 로봇을 빼고 assignment_version 을 올려 다시 배정" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#333333;strokeWidth=2;dashed=0;dashPattern=8 5;fontSize=16;fontColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="48" y="1044" width="860" height="165" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="s7" value="&lt;b&gt;/{robot_id}/mission_assignment&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;aed_interfaces/MissionAssignment · RELIABLE depth 10&lt;br&gt;목표 좌표는 이 메시지에만 실린다 (MissionStatus 에는 상태만)&lt;br&gt;cancel_previous=true 면 받는 쪽이 기존 goal 을 취소한다" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#333333;strokeWidth=2;dashed=0;dashPattern=8 5;fontSize=14;fontColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="228" y="1238" width="680" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="s8" value="&lt;b&gt;⑤ mission_executor ×2  ·  robot_missions&lt;/b&gt;  [구현]&lt;br&gt;배정을 Nav2 goal 로 옮긴다. goal_serial 로 늦게 온 결과를 버린다&lt;br&gt;cancel_previous 면 기존 goal 을 cancel_goal_async() 로 취소&lt;br&gt;발행 /aed/mission_status · RELIABLE depth 10" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#333333;strokeWidth=2;dashed=0;dashPattern=8 5;fontSize=16;fontColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="48" y="1377" width="860" height="123" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="s9" value="&lt;b&gt;/{robot_id}/navigate_to_pose&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;nav2_msgs/action/NavigateToPose  (Topic 아님 · Action)&lt;br&gt;goal: PoseStamped(map) / feedback: 남은 거리 / result: 성공·실패" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#333333;strokeWidth=2;dashed=0;dashPattern=8 5;fontSize=14;fontColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="228" y="1539" width="680" height="89" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="s10" value="&lt;b&gt;⑥ Nav2 + TurtleBot4 ×2  ·  주행&lt;/b&gt;  [하드웨어]&lt;br&gt;bt_navigator · planner · controller · AMCL (공용 지도 maps/map.yaml)&lt;br&gt;출력 /{robot_id}/cmd_vel · geometry_msgs/Twist · 최대 0.20 m/s&lt;br&gt;센서 /scan · /odom · /battery_state · /dock_status  (BEST_EFFORT)&lt;br&gt;카메라 /{robot_id}/oakd/rgb/image_raw/compressed (BEST_EFFORT)" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#333333;strokeWidth=2;dashed=0;dashPattern=8 5;fontSize=16;fontColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="48" y="1668" width="860" height="144" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="s11" value="&lt;b&gt;센서값을 모아 RobotState 로 옮기는 일&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;/odom → 위치·속도 · /battery_state → 배터리 · /dock_status → 도킹" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#C0392B;strokeWidth=2;dashed=0;dashPattern=8 5;fontSize=14;fontColor=#C0392B;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="228" y="1862" width="680" height="68" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="s12" value="&lt;b&gt;⑦ robot_state_monitor ×2  ·  로봇 상태 집계&lt;/b&gt;  [뼈대 · 콜백 없음]&lt;br&gt;패키지와 노드는 있으나 콜백이 비어 있다 (29줄 scaffold)&lt;br&gt;이것이 없어서 관제의 로봇 카드가 빈칸으로 남는다&lt;br&gt;시연에서는 tools/demo_publisher.py 가 bag 의 odom·battery 를 옮긴다" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#C0392B;strokeWidth=2;dashed=1;dashPattern=8 5;fontSize=16;fontColor=#C0392B;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="48" y="1980" width="860" height="123" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="s13" value="&lt;b&gt;/{camera_id}/vision/debug/compressed&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;sensor_msgs/CompressedImage · BEST_EFFORT depth 1 · 15 Hz&lt;br&gt;검출 상자가 그려진 그림. 최신 프레임만 의미가 있어 밀리면 버린다&lt;br&gt;함께: /{camera_id}/vision/person_count · std_msgs/UInt32 · RELIABLE" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#333333;strokeWidth=2;dashed=0;dashPattern=8 5;fontSize=14;fontColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="940" y="482" width="520" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="s14" value="&lt;b&gt;/aed/mission_status&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;aed_interfaces/MissionStatus · RELIABLE depth 20&lt;br&gt;상태 14종. 한 번만 오므로 놓치면 그 기록이 영영 없다&lt;br&gt;배정도 함께 구독한다 /{robot_id}/mission_assignment (목표 좌표)" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#333333;strokeWidth=2;dashed=0;dashPattern=8 5;fontSize=14;fontColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="940" y="1097" width="520" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="s15" value="&lt;b&gt;/aed/robot_state  ← 발행하는 노드가 없다&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;aed_interfaces/RobotState · RELIABLE depth 20&lt;br&gt;관제는 구독하고 있으나 아무것도 안 온다&lt;br&gt;AED_HMI_STATE_RELIABILITY=best_effort 로 BEST_EFFORT 전환 가능" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#C0392B;strokeWidth=2;dashed=0;dashPattern=8 5;fontSize=14;fontColor=#C0392B;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="940" y="2009" width="520" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="s16" value="&lt;b&gt;aed_hmi  ·  관제&lt;/b&gt;  [구현]" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#333333;strokeWidth=2;dashed=0;dashPattern=8 5;fontSize=16;fontColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1500" y="150" width="500" height="1953" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="s17" value="&lt;b&gt;aed_hmi_bridge (rclpy 스레드)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;ros/bridge.py — rclpy 를 아는 유일한 곳&lt;br&gt;구독이 안 붙으면 토픽 이름을 대어 로그에 적는다&lt;br&gt;QoS 가 어긋나면 ROS 2 는 조용히 연결을 안 맺는다" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#333333;strokeWidth=2;dashed=0;dashPattern=8 5;fontSize=13;fontColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1520" y="208" width="460" height="105" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="s18" value="&lt;b&gt;ros/converters.py&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;uint8 → 이름 문자열 · Time → UTC epoch 초&lt;br&gt;여기서만 aed_interfaces 를 안다" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#333333;strokeWidth=2;dashed=0;dashPattern=8 5;fontSize=13;fontColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1520" y="573" width="460" height="84" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="s19" value="&lt;b&gt;context.on_*  ← 갈림길&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;같은 값이 두 갈래로 간다&lt;br&gt;Ⓐ 메모리(LiveState) · Ⓑ SQLite(Repository)" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#333333;strokeWidth=2;dashed=0;dashPattern=8 5;fontSize=13;fontColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1520" y="917" width="460" height="84" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="s20" value="&lt;b&gt;SQLite  ·  var/aed_hmi.sqlite3&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;emergency_events · mission_assignments&lt;br&gt;mission_events · robot_samples · eta_records&lt;br&gt;상태 전이는 덧붙이기만 한다. 요약은 매번 되짚는다" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#333333;strokeWidth=2;dashed=0;dashPattern=8 5;fontSize=13;fontColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1520" y="1261" width="460" height="105" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="s21" value="&lt;b&gt;FastAPI  ·  :8000&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;WS /ws/live — 0.25초마다 스냅샷 (메모리에서)&lt;br&gt;GET /api/missions · /api/stats/* (SQLite 에서)&lt;br&gt;MJPEG /api/video/{stream_id}" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;fillColor=#FFFF